// endpoint_set_workspace_model.proto — SetWorkspaceModel: set ANOTHER
// workspace's model, compacting its conversation first. SIDEBAR section. The
// agent API's one way to set a model (`agent-repld workspace model`): an
// agent never sends `/model` as a prompt
// (SubmitPromptError.slash_command_from_agent), and the topbar selector's own
// request (SetModel) takes no requester.
//
// THE ORDER IS STRUCTURAL. The daemon (1) checks the model against the
// catalog ListCreationModels offers for the workspace's repository, then (2)
// submits the compaction exactly as CompactWorkspace does, then (3) awaits
// the compaction's turn ending as a latch (never a sleep), and only then (4)
// sets the model through the same verb SetModel calls. A model not in the
// catalog is refused before anything is compacted. A compaction that does not
// complete leaves the model unchanged.
//
// Success means the model is SET: unlike CompactWorkspace's success
// (SUBMITTED), this rpc answers once the compaction has finished, which may
// be after a running turn ends.

